# VNeID Review AI Agent — Sequence Diagram

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor FE as Frontend
    participant BE as Business Service
    participant DB as Database
    participant Q as Queue (Python in-app)
    participant AI as AI Agent
    participant RAG as RAG / Knowledge Base
    participant LLM as LLM

    %% User tạo review → BE tự enqueue job (không có endpoint process riêng)
    FE->>BE: POST /api/apps/{package_name}/reviews
    BE->>DB: Insert review (bot_reply_status = PENDING)
    BE->>Q: Enqueue review job
    BE-->>FE: 201 Created (không chờ AI xử lý)

    %% Async processing
    Q->>AI: Consume review job
    AI->>DB: Update bot_reply_status = PROCESSING

    %% AI decides whether RAG is needed
    AI->>AI: Analyze review & decide if guidance is needed

    alt Review needs VNeID guidance
        AI->>RAG: Retrieve relevant VNeID knowledge
        RAG-->>AI: Relevant context
        AI->>LLM: Generate reply + review + RAG context
    else No guidance needed
        AI->>LLM: Generate reply from review
    end

    LLM-->>AI: Generated reply
    AI->>DB: Save AI reply (insert bot comment)
    AI->>DB: Update bot_reply_status = COMPLETED

    %% User reloads page
    FE->>BE: GET /reviews
    BE->>DB: Query reviews + AI replies
    DB-->>BE: Reviews + replies
    BE-->>FE: Return reviews + AI replies
```

